{"id":"vod_bf_25658","vodId":"25658","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"排球少年第二季","name_cn":"排球少年第二季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-26/0d021e3e76015a539aec2b6aa9faaf51.jpg"},"summary":"排球少年第二季剧情介绍：全集动画是排球少年的续集作品，排球少年第二季全集动画讲述的是小时候，日向翔阳从电视上看见排球比赛，乌野高中的一名小个子在球上的英姿，简直就是个“小巨人”，对此非常深刻，并开始迷上排球，一直想成为“小巨人”一样的人。初中时排球部不够人数，只好默默等待，后来在终于有新成员后，参与了第一次也是最后一赛的比赛，不幸对决了最强队伍，结果当然落败。单凭自己的话，是绝对无办法看见那景色的，不是自己一人的话，或许就能看见了…为了能够打出“胜利”的比赛，翔阳努力考入乌野高中，实现成为“小巨人”的排球梦想！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动画,运动,情,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 18:01:56","classic":true,"classicRank":33,"franchise":"排球少年","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"OAD","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/paiqiushaoniandierji/OAD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/paiqiushaoniandierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/paiqiushaoniandierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/paiqiushaoniandierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/paiqiushaoniandierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/paiqiushaoniandierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202410075YOC4vbwindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241007omak6oZ5index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/paiqiushaoniandierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241007pyNrUxvhindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/paiqiushaoniandierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/paiqiushaoniandierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集